# Dependencies for the steganalysis suite (tests/steganalysis).
#
# Deliberately minimal and separate from the other two lockfiles. The detectors
# themselves are not Python: zsteg is a Ruby gem and StegExpose is a Java jar, both
# installed by the CI job. All this environment needs is a test runner.
#
# It must stay separate from requirements-compliance.lock, whose crypto-condor
# bounds (cryptography<44, cffi<2) have nothing to do with this suite, and from
# requirements.in, which is the decoder's four runtime dependencies.
